fflib-apex-common (Apex Enterprise Patterns)
https://github.com/apex-enterprise-patterns/fflib-apex-common

Design only; no fflib code is included. The application layout follows it:
one Application holding query (selector), domain and service factories
registered by type, a domain layer that handles triggers, and a unit of work
(force-app/classes/application, force-app/classes/domain, force-app/classes/work).
